Original commit body from 9aaf4ac:

Implements _format_structure_tree() which renders directory structure
as a tree visualization built from important files. Per ADR-0005:

- Shows paths to important files revealing directory organization
- Displays sibling counts as "[and N other items]"
- Respects max_root_dirs limit
- Falls back to simple format when no important files provided
- Excludes patterns from sibling counts

This prepares for the full ADR-0005 structure integration where
important files will be sampled from config, tests, entry points,
and source files to build the tree.
